  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "启动与形态",
      "items": [
        "dsh CLI 与具名 profile 是唯一 Node 应用入口 (web / headless / sdk / sdk-minimal / acp)",
        "bundle 按 profile 层叠组合，patch 覆写任意配置行；sdk-minimal 不用 dsh-base",
        "Python SDK 运行时打包 dsh CLI，以 --profile sdk 启动"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "核心语义",
      "items": [
        "每个产品件都是 Cordis 插件，无特权核心；注册即 effect，随插件卸载回滚",
        "ctx.sessions 提供 append-only SessionEvent 日志；model-visible 必可重构自日志",
        "ctx.agentLoop 是唯一具体驱动；扩展挂在 agent/*、tools/*、llm/stream 瀑布上"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "能力缝隙",
      "items": [
        "缝隙 = Service Definition + Service Provider + Consumer 三角色，缺一不可",
        "provider 整体可换：fs/subprocess 指向远程沙箱时 bash、PTY、LSP 随之迁移",
        "外部子代理后端 (Codex/Claude Code/ACP) 经 ctx.subprocess 派生",
        "审批瀑布无应答即 fail closed；ACP 桥为自己的 agent 应答"
      ]
    }
  ]
}